.omne

# Rust
/target/
**/target/
Cargo.lock.bak

# Runtime artifacts (grex CLI append-only event log — written when grex runs in a workspace)
grex.jsonl
**/grex.jsonl

# grex runtime state directory (per-workspace .grex/ — events.jsonl etc.)
.grex/
**/.grex/

# real-smoke fixture seeds — track .grex/pack.yaml but not generated artifacts
!scripts/real-smoke-fixtures/*/.grex/
!scripts/real-smoke-fixtures/*/.grex/pack.yaml

# editors
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
.claude/

# OS
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# Lean4 build artifacts (proof/ — see .omne/concurrency.md §Lean4 invariant)
proof/build/
proof/.lake/
proof/lake-packages/

# mdBook site output (grex-doc/ — built artefact, deployed by doc-site.yml)
grex-doc/book/

# CWD-fossil files dropped by external tooling (cc-cfg statusline probes, etc.)
claude-statusline-probe.txt
*statusline-probe*.txt

# Real-smoke fixture local clones (created by scripts/provision-real-smoke-fixtures.ps1)
scripts/real-smoke-fixtures/*/.git/
scripts/real-smoke-fixtures/*/.git
